---
alwaysApply: false
---

- ids: `H=@H-{NNN}@`; `REQ=@REQ-{MODULE}-{NNN}@`; `UJ=@UJ-{PHASE}-{NNN}@`; `DES=@DES-{SUBTYPE}-{NNN}@`; `IMP|UT|IT=@{PFX}-{MODULE}-{LAYER}-{NNN}@`; `E2E=@E2E-{PHASE}-{NNN}@`
- nums: `NNN=001..999`; zero-pad; ascending per prefix namespace; no reuse
- ann: `@TAG@ (FROM: @UP-1@[, @UP-2@ ...])`
- ann: `@E2E-...@ (TECHNICAL)`
- edges+: `H->REQ`; `REQ->UJ`; `REQ->DES`; `REQ->IMP`; `DES->IMP`; `IMP->UT`; `IMP->IT`; `UJ->E2E`
- edges+: `IMP` may cite `REQ` + `DES`
- edges-: reverse; cycles; `E2E->IMP`; `UT|IT->REQ|DES`; `DES->H`; `UT->IT|E2E`; `IT->UT|E2E`
- `H`: `docs/risk_management/**/*.md`; `<!-- ... -->`; line above `##|###`; registry none; source `docs/risk_management/safety_hazards.md`
- `REQ`: `docs/requirements/**/*.md`; excl `README.md|traceability_matrix.md`; `<!-- ... -->`; line above `##|###`; `FROM: @H-...@`; registry `trace/requirements/{module}.yaml`; fields `title|hazard|file`
- `UJ`: `docs/journeys/**/*.md`; excl `README.md`; `<!-- ... -->`; line above `##|###`; `FROM: @REQ-...@`; registry `trace/journeys/{phase}.yaml`; fields `title|req|file`
- `DES`: `docs/architecture/**/*.md|docs/ux/**/*.md|docs/api/**/*.md`; excl `000-template.md|README.md`; `<!-- ... -->`; line above `##|###`; `FROM: @REQ-...@`; registry `trace/design/{subtype}.yaml`; fields `title|req|file`
- `IMP`: `frontend/src/**/*.ts`; excl `*.spec.ts|*.int.spec.ts`; `// ...`; line above traced `export|function|statement|branch`; one tag per logical unit; merge upstreams; `FROM: @REQ-...@|@DES-...@`; registry `trace/implementation/{module}.yaml`; fields `title|req?|des?|files`; `req|des >=1`
- `UT`: `frontend/src/**/*.spec.ts`; excl `*.int.spec.ts`; `// ...`; line above `it|it.each|traced data row`; never `describe`; `FROM: @IMP-...@`; registry `trace/unit_test/{module}.yaml`; fields `title|impl|files`
- `IT`: `frontend/**/*.int.spec.ts`; `// ...`; line above `it|it.each|traced data row`; never `describe`; `FROM: @IMP-...@`; registry `trace/integration_test/{module}.yaml`; fields `title|impl|files`
- `E2E-business`: `frontend/tests/e2e/**/*.feature`; `# ...`; line above exec tags, before `Scenario`; `FROM: @UJ-...@`; tags `@UJ-... @phase-X @e2e`; optional scenario tag; registry `trace/e2e/{phase-or-domain}.yaml`; fields `title|files`; no upstream dup in registry
- `E2E-technical`: `frontend/tests/e2e/**/*.feature`; `# @E2E-...@ (TECHNICAL)`; no `FROM`; tags `@phase-X` + `@smoke|@technical-e2e`; non-business only
- `E2E` trace tags: `.feature` only; never step defs `*.ts`
- registries: `trace/{requirements|journeys|design|implementation|unit_test|integration_test|e2e}/`
- registries: source-of-truth=`H` hazard log / `REQ|UJ|DES` markdown / `IMP|UT|IT|E2E` source file
- registries: new traced artifact => entry same commit
- registries: delete => mark `deleted|obsolete`; never remove
- cross-check: every source tag <-> registry entry; every registry `file|files` path exists
- inv `001`: every `IMP` >=1 upstream `REQ|DES`
- inv `002`: every `UT` >=1 upstream `IMP`
- inv `003`: every `IT` >=1 upstream `IMP`
- inv `004`: every business `E2E` >=1 upstream `UJ`
- inv `005`: every non-deprecated `REQ`-realizing `IMP` >=1 downstream `UT|IT|E2E via UJ`
- inv `006`: every `UJ` >=1 upstream `REQ`
- inv `007`: unique ID per prefix namespace
- inv `008`: one defining source file per tag; extra citations ok
- inv `009`: every `FROM` target exists
- inv `010`: DAG only
- inv `011`: allowed edge types only
